OL,3,GNEWSAPortugal trip fans say 'it may
OL,4,Anever come again'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Sunderland fans are making
OL,7,Fthe journey to north-west Portugal for
OL,8,Fthe team's first competitive fixture on
OL,9,Fmainland Europe in 53 years.
OL,11,FSunderland AFC play Portuguese second
OL,12,Fdivision team Torreense in the Europa
OL,13,FLeague on Thursday but as the host's
OL,14,Fgrounds are so small, the game will be
OL,15,Fheld about 66 miles (106km) away in the
OL,16,Fcity of Leiria.
OL,18,FTo reach the city, Sunderland fan
OL,19,FMatthew Keeling drove to Liverpool from
OL,20,Fwhere he flew to Porto - followed by a
OL,21,Ftwo-hour bus journey.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
