OL,3,GNEWSAPortugal trip fans say 'it may
OL,4,Anever come again'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said it felt "weird" to be following
OL,7,Fhis team across Europe and he did not
OL,8,Fthink "anyone really knows what to
OL,9,Fexpect".
